Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:06.55,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.53,0:00:17.60,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.51,0:00:22.47,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.38,0:00:26.11,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.01,0:00:33.58,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.35,0:00:40.09,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.73,0:00:48.10,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.37,0:00:54.33,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.51,0:00:58.10,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:01:02.84,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.25,0:01:09.28,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.46,0:01:20.89,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.07,0:01:46.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么会被击败
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.78,0:01:57.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不会输给你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.65,0:02:00.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.85,0:02:07.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是我用错方法了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.96,0:02:15.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我绝对没有有弄错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.90,0:02:21.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有这个四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.27,0:02:24.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论几次都可以重新再来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.47,0:02:25.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.68,0:02:28.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这里是什么地方吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.78,0:02:29.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是人的话就离开
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.11,0:02:32.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是妖怪的话就要消灭你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.41,0:02:33.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别乱来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.52,0:02:36.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是巫女 椿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.12,0:02:39.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是曾在此地修行的人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.79,0:02:48.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第63话 阻挡在前的红白巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.59,0:02:53.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是令人怀念
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.82,0:02:56.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和当年几乎没什么改变呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.16,0:02:59.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是红叶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.80,0:03:01.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是牡丹
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.36,0:03:04.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在守着这里的只有你们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.40,0:03:07.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是师父最后的弟子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.10,0:03:09.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.64,0:03:13.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿师姐也是我们师父的弟子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.04,0:03:17.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 请问您今年贵庚了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.38,0:03:19.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坦白说您看起来满年轻的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.18,0:03:23.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比你们两个年纪大是一定的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.39,0:03:25.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是修行的成果
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.85,0:03:28.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有能保持青春的法术吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:30.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要你们也不断继续修行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.03,0:03:32.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是能办得到的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.00,0:03:36.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过可不是简单的事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.70,0:03:38.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么椿师姐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.00,0:03:42.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么事情让您回到这里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:03:45.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在正被妖怪追着
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.34,0:03:46.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.71,0:03:49.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 这两人该怎么处理
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.28,0:03:51.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不要杀掉她们算了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.21,0:03:53.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请让我们帮助您 椿师姐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.45,0:03:56.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为椿师姐是我们的师姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.59,0:04:08.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 从那之后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.23,0:04:14.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我受到了黑巫女 椿的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.22,0:04:28.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经没事了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.55,0:04:30.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.22,0:04:32.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.99,0:04:34.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.29,0:04:35.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.29,0:04:36.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.66,0:04:38.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的没事了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.86,0:04:43.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诅咒者的名字是椿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.67,0:04:45.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这和五十年前与桔梗姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:49.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并驾齐驱的巫女的名字一模一样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.94,0:04:52.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么为何是黑巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.44,0:04:53.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.18,0:04:57.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许只是凑巧名字相同
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.88,0:04:59.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.31,0:05:01.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感受到四魂之玉了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.95,0:05:04.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的吗 戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.25,0:05:05.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 很清楚的感受到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.82,0:05:07.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也只有那块大号的碎片吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.76,0:05:09.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 在哪个方向
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.83,0:05:13.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.40,0:05:16.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有去看看了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.03,0:05:20.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是取回四魂之玉的大好机会
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.84,0:05:22.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊 枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.70,0:05:23.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也想跟去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.04,0:05:25.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对方是黑巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.47,0:05:28.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这个巫女跟着去比较好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.98,0:05:29.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要说巫女的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.98,0:05:31.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都老太婆了还算是巫女吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.91,0:05:32.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.11,0:05:35.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.42,0:05:38.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没礼貌的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.62,0:05:40.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.72,0:05:42.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.86,0:05:44.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.73,0:05:45.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.93,0:05:48.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.36,0:05:49.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.93,0:05:54.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 不要把我忘啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.95,0:06:05.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿 你领悟的很快
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.15,0:06:07.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗 师父
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.15,0:06:09.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.96,0:06:17.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从那之后过了六十年
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.39,0:06:21.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,师父当然已经离开人世了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.60,0:06:23.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿师姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.53,0:06:26.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,使用这座馆代代相传的护符
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.97,0:06:29.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该就能消灭妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.54,0:06:31.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 该怎么做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.54,0:06:34.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请交给我们 椿师姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.54,0:06:35.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使无法消灭妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.18,0:06:37.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少能抵挡一阵子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.91,0:06:39.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们办得到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.18,0:06:41.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对方可是相当邪恶的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:43.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也累积了许多修行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.12,0:06:47.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消灭妖怪是我们巫女的天职
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.12,0:06:50.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么就交给你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.99,0:06:52.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽量帮我争取时间
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.06,0:06:54.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.63,0:07:02.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些如何 红叶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.37,0:07:05.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有这些就没问题了 牡丹
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.21,0:07:07.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是这是第一次呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.94,0:07:10.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才要放手一搏啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.71,0:07:13.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的 这也是一种修行与经验
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.52,0:07:17.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.59,0:07:19.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去消灭妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.17,0:07:41.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这扇门绝对不能打开
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.98,0:07:44.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这是禁忌的多宝塔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.42,0:07:51.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,禁忌吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.19,0:07:57.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.43,0:08:01.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落要你归还四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.76,0:08:03.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.87,0:08:06.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是说好奈落的愿望实现了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.63,0:08:09.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才将它交给你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.37,0:08:10.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会用这块四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.01,0:08:13.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来实现约定的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.38,0:08:14.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个叫戈薇的女人也好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.78,0:08:17.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉也好 我会杀掉所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.28,0:08:18.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.58,0:08:20.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是已经输了一次吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.52,0:08:23.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个地方拥有力量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.65,0:08:28.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有四魂之玉 就能够利用的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.46,0:08:30.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得你没啥自信呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.66,0:08:33.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你一件好事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.73,0:08:34.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.86,0:08:38.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,使用四魂之玉最好的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.11,0:08:46.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.24,0:08:47.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.74,0:08:50.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.38,0:08:51.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.39,0:09:00.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那什么东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.96,0:09:02.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是结界
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.39,0:09:08.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们巫女设下的 让妖怪无法进入的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.53,0:09:10.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是椿搞的鬼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.40,0:09:12.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉的气息在前面
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.64,0:09:16.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种结界我马上就打破它
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.81,0:09:18.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.54,0:09:21.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.65,0:09:30.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了好了 这可不是闹着玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.05,0:09:33.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是对妖怪才有反应的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.42,0:09:37.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就交给我和枫姥姥吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.43,0:09:39.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现身了吗 妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.79,0:09:41.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你好久了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.80,0:09:45.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是要追杀椿师姐的妖怪 犬夜叉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.03,0:09:49.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊 你们是椿的同伙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.44,0:09:51.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿师姐是我们的师姐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:53.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们当然站在她那边
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.68,0:09:55.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们也是黑巫女吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.44,0:09:57.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就饶不了你们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.31,0:09:58.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑巫女？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.58,0:10:00.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然愚弄我们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.45,0:10:01.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不是黑巫女吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.05,0:10:03.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少胡说八道 妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.22,0:10:05.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字是红叶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.59,0:10:08.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字是牡丹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.86,0:10:12.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是学习消灭妖怪的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.33,0:10:15.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别和诅咒别人的黑巫女混为一谈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.33,0:10:17.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得她们蛮正派的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.97,0:10:21.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们不是椿的手下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.20,0:10:22.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.24,0:10:23.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个先稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.97,0:10:24.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.11,0:10:27.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看的出来 你是法师吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.61,0:10:29.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是驱魔师对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.08,0:10:31.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.58,0:10:34.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么奇怪的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.85,0:10:36.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是看起来似乎有灵力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.49,0:10:38.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巫女对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.22,0:10:41.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也可以这么说啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.99,0:10:45.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且为什么要和这种妖怪在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.73,0:10:47.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们把我当妖怪吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.63,0:10:50.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可没做过害人的事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.87,0:10:51.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.13,0:10:55.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌啦红叶 他长得好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.64,0:10:57.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊 好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.38,0:11:02.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只也好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.88,0:11:04.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.65,0:11:06.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.51,0:11:07.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.75,0:11:09.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们看起来不像是坏人耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.89,0:11:13.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少先设法说服她们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.52,0:11:14.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 两位姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.02,0:11:16.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.66,0:11:19.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭妖怪！居然伪装成这副模样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.27,0:11:30.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幻化成可爱的模样蒙骗那些人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.44,0:11:31.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是对我们是没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.11,0:11:34.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们才不会被你的外表欺骗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.91,0:11:38.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我吗？我很坏吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.78,0:11:40.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你慌张个什么劲啊 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.92,0:11:42.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再挡路的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.18,0:11:44.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使用武力我也要硬闯了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.19,0:11:45.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:47.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再让我试着说服看看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.79,0:11:50.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上吧 牡丹
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.19,0:11:52.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的 红叶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.43,0:11:54.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.83,0:11:57.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.70,0:11:58.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.57,0:12:00.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几时过来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.20,0:12:03.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何我们会和那些妖怪在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.44,0:12:04.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就让我说明吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.07,0:12:09.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说起来 一切的源头都是四魂之玉的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.94,0:12:12.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪们对于它的妖力…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.68,0:12:14.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.22,0:12:16.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.82,0:12:18.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你向妖怪出卖自己的心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.45,0:12:19.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成他们的同伙对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.82,0:12:21.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手 手…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.19,0:12:23.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被妖怪下了诅咒了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.86,0:12:26.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那根本不是诅咒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.59,0:12:27.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办啦 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.10,0:12:29.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把事情弄得更麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.83,0:12:33.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不好意思 我不小心就…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.33,0:12:34.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿在那边吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.97,0:12:36.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,休想过去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.34,0:12:38.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.86,0:12:54.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.99,0:12:56.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是式神
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.26,0:13:00.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让魂魄寄宿在纸娃娃上 借以操纵它的法术
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.50,0:13:07.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些家伙很弱耶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.37,0:13:09.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本不用认真对付嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.87,0:13:12.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.05,0:13:19.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很有两下子嘛 妖怪们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.78,0:13:22.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才只是牛刀小试
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.89,0:13:26.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是为了拿到你们的头发
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.66,0:13:30.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们两个该不会…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.39,0:13:32.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.39,0:13:35.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们想用式神复制我们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.40,0:13:36.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你居然会知道 老妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.17,0:13:38.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.68,0:13:51.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,复制的话 会复制谁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.91,0:13:53.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.31,0:13:55.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管对手是谁 通通揍扁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:00.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.96,0:14:02.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这该不会是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.69,0:14:04.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也觉得好像是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.69,0:14:06.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是犬夜叉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.69,0:14:08.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不是那副鸟样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.56,0:14:11.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那 那个…该不会是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.70,0:14:13.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.57,0:14:14.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想也是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.57,0:14:15.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.94,0:14:18.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个该不会是戈薇吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.31,0:14:23.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.81,0:14:26.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不是那个样子啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.20,0:14:42.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是隆重的仪式啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.33,0:14:44.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,封印有这么坚固吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.84,0:14:47.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是为了打开门的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.31,0:14:50.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面还布下了更强的封印
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.95,0:15:01.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做得不错呢 牡丹
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.85,0:15:04.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做得好可爱呢 红叶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.96,0:15:06.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 吓到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.86,0:15:08.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不只是姿态而已
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.13,0:15:12.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能力也是原原本本的复制了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.23,0:15:12.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本不像
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.13,0:15:14.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点都不像
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.23,0:15:16.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.30,0:15:21.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种装腔作势的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.47,0:15:24.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.74,0:15:26.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.99,0:15:36.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要妨碍我 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.75,0:15:39.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要对那家伙叫我的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.49,0:15:44.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.50,0:15:46.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果那个式神也是犬夜叉的话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.86,0:15:47.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.64,0:15:57.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你突然搞什么鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.51,0:15:59.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.41,0:16:03.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来身上物品的能力没办法复制
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.18,0:16:05.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过是个冒牌货
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.15,0:16:07.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然有点令人羡慕啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.02,0:16:13.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿嘿 你那什么刀啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.89,0:16:15.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.67,0:16:23.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇！想办法对付那个戈薇啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.04,0:16:24.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.90,0:16:27.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要用我的名字叫那个东西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.54,0:16:30.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉才是 想点办法对付那个犬夜叉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.31,0:16:31.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那才不是我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.31,0:16:34.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唉呀呀 真是没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.05,0:16:36.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,轮到我们上场了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.32,0:16:39.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话是这么说…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.32,0:16:43.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的是很难对付耶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.82,0:16:44.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.69,0:16:46.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇那边麻烦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.46,0:16:48.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要再叫戈薇了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.33,0:16:51.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唉呀 我比较想消灭犬夜叉耶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.33,0:16:52.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就说那不是我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.10,0:16:54.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是 犬夜叉的话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.97,0:16:56.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能毫不留情扁他一顿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.70,0:16:57.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.57,0:16:59.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些家伙什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.07,0:17:01.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.21,0:17:03.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪开你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.34,0:17:05.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种角色
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.51,0:17:07.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用风之伤马上就能解决
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.89,0:17:16.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.66,0:17:22.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身体…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.83,0:17:24.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.40,0:17:26.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的行动已经被封住了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.50,0:17:30.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.27,0:17:34.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可爱的那只也很痛苦耶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.71,0:17:37.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法呀…谁叫他是妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.28,0:17:39.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个还不住手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.64,0:17:42.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个老妖怪居然还能够动
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.28,0:17:43.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.65,0:17:45.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.29,0:17:48.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们几个
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.19,0:17:49.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是再妨碍我们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.32,0:17:51.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就把你们和妖怪一起消灭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.36,0:17:53.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.39,0:17:55.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们并没有做那种要被人家消灭的坏事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.16,0:17:57.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.30,0:17:59.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先让这两个巫女安份下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.93,0:18:01.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 没办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.57,0:18:05.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要妨碍我们消灭妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.67,0:18:08.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.64,0:18:11.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我节制点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.05,0:18:17.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再不节制点的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.85,0:18:23.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难缠的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.09,0:18:24.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会认输的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.12,0:18:26.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.59,0:18:27.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注意了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.60,0:18:36.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身体能动了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.24,0:18:41.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.88,0:18:53.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.02,0:19:01.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.66,0:19:07.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.64,0:19:12.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是失去了意识
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.87,0:19:15.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有生命的危险
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.31,0:19:17.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里好像也没有受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.27,0:19:19.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.61,0:19:22.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这两人该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.75,0:19:23.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们醒过来之后
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.88,0:19:26.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会又袭击我们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.53,0:19:27.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是被椿欺骗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.90,0:19:28.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是被花言巧语拐骗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.26,0:19:31.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正只要好好的解释
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.70,0:19:33.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该就能让她们了解
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.43,0:19:36.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁要做这种苦差事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.30,0:19:38.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然是由我来做了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.41,0:19:40.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由我来照顾她们两人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.01,0:19:43.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好的向她们说明吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.28,0:19:46.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 你和弥勒法师一起留在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.51,0:19:49.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我？但是我要做什么才好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.78,0:19:52.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要监视弥勒法师就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.34,0:19:56.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且如果是七宝的话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.51,0:19:59.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许更容易说服她们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.45,0:20:00.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会好好加油的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.98,0:20:03.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 你也留在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.95,0:20:06.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便你们 我要去追椿了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.09,0:20:08.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.76,0:20:16.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先等结界解除了再说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.33,0:20:21.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即将打开了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.57,0:20:23.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里到底有什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.91,0:20:26.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.11,0:20:33.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,百年前的当家 丧失了许多同门的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.25,0:20:36.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也仅能将其封印的鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.72,0:20:39.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么厉害的鬼在这里面
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.42,0:20:40.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从此以后
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.52,0:20:42.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当家们一代又一代的封住了它
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.66,0:20:47.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总有一天你也必须 接下这个重责大任
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.26,0:20:49.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 师父
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.23,0:20:54.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是绝对不能打开的 禁忌的多宝塔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.25,0:21:08.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,封印在这座多宝塔的鬼非常强
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.08,0:21:10.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.52,0:21:13.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打算用四魂之玉驾驭它吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.16,0:21:16.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 我想试着用看看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.63,0:21:20.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对不会 就这样善罢甘休的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.60,0:21:26.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像已经能看见了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.20,0:21:28.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉的气息在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.40,0:21:30.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿就在那里面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.81,0:21:39.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.68,0:21:40.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.98,0:21:43.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连门也布下了结界
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.56,0:21:53.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太乱来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.83,0:21:57.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚出来 椿！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.25,0:22:19.98,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟要流多少泪{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.12,0:22:26.89,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  才能坦白面对自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.76,0:22:33.72,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倘若对谁传达情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.50,0:22:40.46,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  是否就能得到满足{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.01,0:22:47.07,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕着漫长漫长的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.51,0:22:53.98,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着遥远的星星祈祷着{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.79,0:23:00.95,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.76,0:23:07.67,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找真正的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.30,0:23:14.73,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望自己能够变得更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.08,0:23:21.34,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天也要抬头看着高高的天空{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.88,0:23:27.95,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中{\fad(150,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.59,0:23:34.76,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找生命的意义{\fad(0,350)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.18,0:23:48.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.28,0:23:50.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我会输给桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.68,0:23:51.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么塔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.19,0:23:54.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿逃到里面去了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.19,0:23:56.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到底缺少了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.92,0:23:57.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.43,0:24:01.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么果然是椿跟奈落联手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.23,0:24:02.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.23,0:24:05.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要四魂之玉的话就服从我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.70,0:24:08.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.30,0:24:10.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多宝塔的巨大鬼怪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.74,0:24:13.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要得到永远
